#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "ការ​ពិពណ៌នា"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ark; is a program for managing various archive formats within the &kde; "
"environment. Archives can be viewed, extracted, created and modified from "
"within &ark;. The program can handle various formats such as <command>tar</"
"command>, <command>gzip</command>, <command>bzip2</command>, <command>zip</"
"command>, <command>rar</command> and <command>lha</command> (if appropriate "
"command-line programs are installed). &ark; can work closely with "
"&konqueror; in the &kde; environment to handle archives, if you install the "
"&konqueror; Integration plugin available in the kdeaddons package."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &ark;"
msgstr "ដោយ​ប្រើ Ark"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opening Archives"
msgstr "បើក​បណ្ណសារ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To open an archive in &ark;, choose <guimenuitem>Open</guimenuitem> from the "
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> menu. You can also open archive files by dragging "
"and dropping from &konqueror;. Archive files should be associated with "
"&ark;, so you can also <mousebutton>right</mousebutton> click a file in "
"&konqueror; and select <guimenuitem>&ark;</guimenuitem> to open it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working with Files"
msgstr "ធ្វើការ​ជាមួយ​ឯកសារ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once an archive has been opened, you can perform various operations on the "
"files inside the archive. By <mousebutton>right</mousebutton> clicking on a "
"file within the archive, or selecting a file and using the <guimenu>Action</"
"guimenu> menu, you can choose what you want to do:"
msgstr ""
"ពេល​បណ្ណសារ​ត្រូវ​បាន​បើក អ្នក​អាច​ដំណើរ​ការ​ប្រតិបត្តិការ​ផ្សេង​ៗ​លើ​ឯកសារ​ខាងក្នុង​បណ្ណសារ ។ ដោយ​ចុច​ប៊ូតុង "
"<mousebutton>ស្ដាំ</mousebutton> លើ​ឯកសារ​ខាង​ក្នុង​បណ្ណសារ ឬ​ជ្រើស​ឯកសារ និង​ប្រើ​"
"ម៉ឺនុយ<guimenu>សកម្មភាព</guimenu> អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស​អ្វី​ដែល​អ្នក​ចង់​ធ្វើ ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Extract</guimenuitem> will extract the file to a location you "
"specify on disk."
msgstr "<guimenuitem>ដកស្រង់</guimenuitem> នឹង​ដក​ស្រង់​ឯកសារ​ទៅ​ទីតាំង​ដែល​អ្នក​បញ្ជាក់​លើ​ថាស ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> will remove the currently selected file(s) "
"from the archive."
msgstr "<guimenuitem>លុប</guimenuitem> នឹង​យក​ចេញ​ឯកសារ​ដែល​បាន​ជ្រើស​ថ្មីៗ​ពី​បណ្ណសារ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>View</guimenuitem> will open the file in the integrated viewer, "
"or in the default viewer program in case the integrated viewer cannot view "
"the file, or you have disabled it in the Configuration Window."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>មើល</guimenuitem> នឹង​បើក​ឯកសារ​ក្នុង​កម្មវិធី​មើល​ដែល​បាន​រួម​បញ្ចូល ឬ ក្នុង​កម្មវិធី​"
"មើល​លំនាំ​ដើម ក្នុង​ករណី​ដែល​កម្មវិធី​មើល​ដែល​រួម​បញ្ចូល​មិន​អាច​មើល​ឯកសារ ឬ​អ្នក​បាន​បិទ​វា​ក្នុង​បង្អួច​ការ​កំណត់​"
"រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Open With...</guimenuitem> allows you to open the file in a "
"program you choose."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>បើក​ជាមួយ...</guimenuitem> អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​បើក​ឯកសារ​ក្នុង​កម្មវិធី​ដែល​អ្នក​ជ្រើស ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Edit With...</guimenuitem> will open the file a program you "
"choose. The difference between this and <guimenuitem>Open With...</"
"guimenuitem> is that any changes you make will be saved to the file in the "
"archive."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>កែ​សម្រួល​ជាមួយ...</guimenuitem> នឹង​បើក​កម្មវិធី​ជាមួយ​កម្មវិធី​ដែល​អ្នក​ជ្រើស ។ ភាព​"
"ខុស​គ្នា​រវាង​នេះ និង <guimenuitem>បើក​ជាមួយ...</guimenuitem> គឺ​ថា ការ​ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​មួយ​ចំនួន​ដែល​"
"អ្នក​ធ្វើ នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​រក្សា​ទុក​ទៅ​ឯកសារ​ក្នុង​បណ្ណសារ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid "Extracting Archives"
msgstr "ដក​ស្រង់​បណ្ណសារ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once an archive has been opened in &ark;, it can be extracted. To extract "
"files from an archive, you can either select <guimenuitem>Extract...</"
"guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>Action</guimenu> menu or <mousebutton>right</"
"mousebutton> click on the file. The <guilabel>Extract</guilabel> dialog "
"allows you to select where you will extract files to. You can also select "
"which files to extract:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Current</guimenuitem> extracts the most recently selected file. "
"If multiple files are selected, only the most recently selected one will be "
"extracted."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>បច្ចុប្បន្ន</guimenuitem> ដក​ស្រង់​ឯកសារ​ដែល​បាន​ជ្រើស​បច្ចុប្បន្ន​ថ្មីៗ ។ បើ​ឯកសារ​"
"ច្រើន​ត្រូវ​បាន​ជ្រើស មាន​តែ​ឯកសារ​ដែល​បាន​ជ្រើស​ថ្មីៗ​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​ដក​ស្រង់ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>All</guimenuitem> extracts the entire contents of the archive."
msgstr "<guimenuitem>ទាំងអស់</guimenuitem> ដក​ស្រង់​មាតិការ​ទាំងមូល​នៃ​បណ្ណសារ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Selected Files</guimenuitem> extracts all the files which have "
"been selected."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>ឯកសារ​ដែល​បាន​ជ្រើស</guimenuitem> ដក​ស្រង់​ឯកសារ​ទាំងអស់​ដែល​បាន​ត្រូវ​ជ្រើស ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Pattern</guimenuitem> allows you to specify which files will be "
"extracted, corresponding to certain patterns, &eg; <literal role=\"extension"
"\">*.txt</literal> or <literal role=\"extension\">*.jpg</literal>. Note that "
"you can only use one pattern at a time."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>លំនាំ</guimenuitem> អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​បញ្ជាក់​ឯកសារ​ណា​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​ដក​ស្រង់ ដែល​ដូច​គ្នា​"
"ទៅ​លំនាំ​ជាក់លាក់ ឧ. <literal role=\"extension\">*.txt</literal> ឬ <literal role="
"\"extension\">*.jpg</literal> ។ ចំណាំ​ថា​អ្នក​អាច​ប្រើ​តែ​លំនាំ​មួយ​នៅ​ពេល​តែ​មួយ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:153 index.docbook:583
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can specify the folder to extract files to in the <guilabel>Extract to:</"
"guilabel> text box. The default location is the folder the archive is in. "
"You may also choose to have the folder that you extract into open in "
"&konqueror; once the extraction is complete."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​បញ្ជាក់​ថត​ដើម្បី​ដក​ស្រង់​ឯកសារ​ទៅ​ក្នុង​ប្រអប់​អត្ថបទ <guilabel>ដក​ស្រង់​ទៅ ៖</guilabel> ។ "
"ទីតាំង​លំនាំ​ដើម​គឺ​ជា​ថត​ដែល​បណ្ណសារ​នៅ​ក្នុង ។ អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស​ផង​ដែរ​ដើម្បី​មានថត​ដែល​អ្នក​ដក​ស្រង់​ទៅ​ក្នុង បើក​"
"ក្នុង Konqueror ពេល​ការ​ដក​ស្រង់​បញ្ចប់ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating Archives and Adding Files"
msgstr "បង្កើត​បណ្ណសារ និង​បន្ថែម​ឯកសារ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new archive in &ark;, choose <guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem> from "
"the <guimenu>File</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​បង្កើត​បណ្ណសារ​ថ្មី​ក្នុង Ark ជ្រើស <guimenuitem>ថ្មី</guimenuitem> ពី​ម៉ឺនុយ "
"<guimenu>ឯកសារ</guimenu> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can then type the name of the archive, with the appropriate extension "
"(<literal role=\"extension\">tar.gz</literal>, <literal role=\"extension"
"\">zip</literal>, <literal role=\"extension\">bz2</literal> &etc;). To add "
"files to the archive, choose <guimenuitem>Add File...</guimenuitem> from the "
"<guimenu>Action</guimenu> menu. If you want to add an entire folder to an "
"archive, choose <guimenuitem>Add Folder...</guimenuitem> from the "
"<guimenu>Action</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An alternative way to add files to the archive is to drag a file from "
"&konqueror; or the desktop into the main &ark; window, and it will be added "
"to the current archive."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &ark;"
msgstr "កំណត់​រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ Ark"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "ការ​កំណត់​ទូទៅ"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use integrated viewer"
msgstr "ប្រើ​កម្មវិធី​មើល​ដែល​រួម​បញ្ចូល"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the integrated viewer to view files, if possible."
msgstr "ប្រើ​កម្មវិធី​មើល​ដែល​រួម​បញ្ចូល​ដើម្បី​មើល​ឯកសារ បើ​អាច ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:199
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Enable Konqueror integration"
msgid "Enable &konqueror; integration"
msgstr "បើ​ការ​រួម​បញ្ចូល Konqueror"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Enable the plugin for extracting or adding files to archives through "
#| "Konqueror context menus."
msgid ""
"Enable the plugin for extracting or adding files to archives through "
"&konqueror; context menus."
msgstr ""
"បើក​កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ​សម្រាប់​ដក​ស្រង់ ឬ​បន្ថែម​ឯកសារ​ដើម្បី​ធ្វើ​បណ្ណសារ​តាម​រយៈ​ម៉ឺនុយ​បរិបទ Konqueror ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:202
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This option only works if the Konqueror integration plugin from kdeaddons "
#| "is installed on your system."
msgid ""
"This option only works if the &konqueror; integration plugin from kdeaddons "
"is installed on your system."
msgstr ""
"ជម្រើស​នេះ​ធ្វើការតែ​បើ​កម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ​ការ​រួម​បញ្ចូល Konqueror ពី kdeaddons ត្រូវ​បាន​ដំឡើង​នៅ​លើ​ប្រព័ន្ធ​"
"របស់​អ្នក ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid "File Addition Settings"
msgstr "ការ​កំណត់​បន្ថែម​ឯកសារ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:213 index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many of these options are only configurable for specific archive formats. "
"Other formats may behave either way and are not configurable."
msgstr ""
"ជម្រើស​ទាំងនេះ​មួយ​ចំនួន​អាច​កំណត់​រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ​សម្រាប់​ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​បណ្ណសារ​ជាក់លាក់ ។ ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​ផ្សេង​អាច​ធ្វើ​"
"ឥរិយាបថ​ផ្សេង​ទៀត និង​មិន​អាច​កំណត់​រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid "Replace old files only with newer files"
msgstr "ជំនួស​ឯកសារ​ចាស់​តែ​ជាមួយ​ឯកសារ​ថ្មី​ជាង"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you add filenames that already exist in an archive, only replace them if "
"the added files are newer than the ones already present in the archive."
msgstr ""
"បើ​អ្នក​បន្ថែម​ឈ្មោះ​ឯកសារ​ដែល​មាន​រួច​ហើយ​ក្នុង​បណ្ណសារ គ្រាន់​តែ​ជំនួស​ពួក​វា​បើ​ឯកសារ​ដែល​បន្ថែម​ថ្មី​ជាង​"
"ឯកសារ​ដែល​មាន​ក្នុង​បណ្ណសារ ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Force MS-DOS short filenames (Zip)"
msgstr "បង្ខំ​ឈ្មោះ​ឯកសារ​ខ្លី MS-DOS (Zip)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid "Force names to the DOS 8.3 format."
msgstr "បង្ខំ​ឈ្មោះ​ទៅ​ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ DOS ៨.៣ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:241 index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid "Affects only zip files"
msgstr "ប៉ះពាល់​តែ​ឯកសារ zip"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translate LF to DOS CRLF (Zip)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Convert the line endings in text files to DOS format from &UNIX; format."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid "Store symlinks as links (Zip, Rar)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Save links inside the archive, instead of following them and including the "
"files being linked to."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid "Affects zip and rar archives."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recursively add subfolders (Zip, Rar)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you add a folder to an archive, also add any subfolders inside. Affects "
"zip and rar archives"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid "Extraction Settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid "Overwrite files (Zip, Tar, Zoo, Rar)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Overwrite any files that have matching names on disk with the one from the "
"archive."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid "Preserve permissions (Tar)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Save the user, group, and permission settings on files. Use with care, as "
"this may result in files being extracted that do not belong to any valid "
"user on your computer."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ignore folder names (Zip)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:303
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Extract all the files into the extraction folder, ignoring any folder "
"structure in the archive."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid "Convert filenames to lowercase (Zip, Rar)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:310
#, no-c-format
msgid "Convert filenames to uppercase (Rar)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid "Extract all files with all lowercase (or uppercase) names."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:321
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Folders</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:325
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Folders</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:327
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This shows the <guilabel>Folders</guilabel> dialog box, so you can "
"<action>choose the default folders</action>. You can configure a "
"<guilabel>Common folder</guilabel> that will be used for all options, use "
"the last used folder, or a custom folder."
msgstr ""

